            {
              "id": "01c9d09b-0459-48bd-912a-caef3faf7890",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Politics &amp; Protest in Sports</strong></em> was written by Duchess Harris with Cynthia Kennedy Henzel, published by Essential Library, December 15, 2018."
            },
            {
              "id": "a300f812-fcfd-4665-955b-b19825f3eee1",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "4c9f788b-3cfd-4444-8be1-6755086b06bd",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "Politics &amp; Protest in Sports<em> covers the history of athletes of color using their position on the national stage to fight racism and injustice. Boxers, track stars, quarterbacks, and point guards have all shown that sports and protest can indeed mix. Features include a glossary, references, websites, source notes, and an index. Aligned to Common Core Standards and correlated to state standards. Essential Library is an imprint of Abdo Publishing, a division of ABDO.</em>"
            },
            {
              "id": "3a0ca10e-9bb9-456d-ab79-4079a577cfa2",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            }
